Gao Haiming? Awak cari dia buat apa?

20:50.680 --> 20:51.680
Tiehan, mana Gao Haiming?

20:53.240 --> 20:54.400
Macam mana awak kenal Gao Haiming?

21:54.880 --> 21:56.799
Lin Huan'er kerana melanggar peraturan permainan

21:57.000 --> 21:58.519
